{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a streamer management simulation game where you play as an aspiring streamer, a &quot;dark horse&quot; joining AstraLive, the world's largest streaming agency. Over a three-year period, your goal is to reach 10 million followers! You can choose your own development path: Will you become a Zatsudan (Chatting) streamer, a Singer/Music streamer, or a Gaming streamer? You can also choose all-around development and unlock your own story through various different endings! If you are interested in the game, don't forget to add it to your Wishlist! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Character</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to choose your gender. The male player character model is currently still under design, so please look forward to it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/e8be67fa1b84db0967a0ff47e471f22f.avif?t=1767253123\" width=500 height=261 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Management/Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content As an excellent streamer, you will not only need to participate in training programs provided by the streaming agency but also perform extra &quot;Recharges&quot; in your daily life to enhance your professional skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/b7a7e30767b8b901a2897a384da31251.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/b7a7e30767b8b901a2897a384da31251.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/b7a7e30767b8b901a2897a384da31251.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/7dd28cba93b186ae61e7508af6064eba.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/7dd28cba93b186ae61e7508af6064eba.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/7dd28cba93b186ae61e7508af6064eba.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Streamer\u2019s Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An excellent streamer must actively engage with the live chat, block unfriendly messages, and even face off against antis during livestreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside of streaming, you\u2019ll need to gather new topics from everyday life, take on sponsorship deals to earn more coins, invite colleagues for collaboration streams, manage public opinion and risk control, and recruit a reliable support team to back you up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/35cce60e098ade7691b11b70a56281fb.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/35cce60e098ade7691b11b70a56281fb.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/35cce60e098ade7691b11b70a56281fb.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life on the Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to balance work and play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, you need to step away from the internet and take a break on the island.<br>Enjoy delicious street food at the park, watch a movie at the cinema, and spend quality time with your favorite character on a warm and relaxing date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/a578e377b44958257e5e3fc029b951d6.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1094 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/a578e377b44958257e5e3fc029b951d6.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/a578e377b44958257e5e3fc029b951d6.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/23605a484201cc4ff915308ae65ddc24.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1094 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/23605a484201cc4ff915308ae65ddc24.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/23605a484201cc4ff915308ae65ddc24.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/0addf1cc2ae03a67f28b77d2773d559f.poster.avif?t=1767253123\" width=1094 height=620 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/0addf1cc2ae03a67f28b77d2773d559f.webm?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/0addf1cc2ae03a67f28b77d2773d559f.mp4?t=1767253123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Romanceable Characters</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In future versions, the game will offer a total of 8 romanceable characters (4 male and 4 female). Regardless of your own gender, you can interact with, date, or establish a romantic relationship with the characters you like! (Character designs will be revealed gradually later on.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/849eceeed686f7a1c848a6732397e092.avif?t=1767253123\" width=498 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/93eefc3aedf00e676d33b7778a4b8c16.avif?t=1767253123\" width=491 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/7aea3ed9ed7fd0fa0814ed58d5d86f4a.avif?t=1767253123\" width=483 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/e788d0fc7f7ea87843894195d91b6a2f.avif?t=1767253123\" width=483 height=238 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120950/extras/9e8e475c3b2b31aece63d65432af0597.avif?t=1767253123\" width=488 height=238 />